        "cooked": "<blockquote><p><strong>Villain target</strong><span>: any target that is also a Villain card or a Villain character card. If a card affects non-Villain targets, it can affect any targets that are not Villain cards or Villain character cards.</span></p></blockquote><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>Taken from&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/multiverse/gameplay/glossary\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/multiverse/gameplay/glossary</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>basically any card from the villian deck that has hp</p>",
